        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-9" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="776" width="1532.67" x="340" y="1109" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-12" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Mutation burden: MMRd &amp;gt;&amp;gt; MMRp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Fraction of mutations that produce neoantigens: MMRd &amp;lt; MMRp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Genetic immune escape mechanisms (HLA / antigen)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- HLA SNV / frameshift / LOH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;APGs (antigen-presenting genes). &lt;/b&gt;[&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;APGs are genes involved in processing and presenting antigens (peptides).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;They enable tumor cells to display peptides on MHC molecules allows T cells to recognize and kill cancer cells.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Non-genetic (adaptive) immune escape&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- PD-L1 / CTLA-4 expression&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="393" width="300" x="8" y="1417" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-15" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;all FF–WGS samples&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="182" x="638" y="1072.003251953125" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;all FFPE–PS&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="227" x="1445" y="1082" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-18" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 18px;&quot;&gt;Immune dN/dS : Ratio of nonsynonymous / synonymous mutations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;In MHC-presented peptides → Immune selection on tumor mutations&lt;br&gt;Are tumor cells shaped by immune pressure?&lt;br&gt;~1 → Neutral (no immune selection)&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;1 → Negative selection (immune removes antigenic mutations)&lt;br&gt;&amp;gt;1 → Positive selection (tumor escapes immune pressure)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="370" x="4" y="1150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-19" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Measures &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2627&quot; data-end=&quot;2646&quot;&gt;immune activity&lt;/strong&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="36" width="175" x="1782" y="1440.9966259765624" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-21" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;Total mutation burden was &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;correlated strongly with the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;number (+)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;, but &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;not the proportion of antigenic mutations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;immune dNdS values showed a reversed, albeit highly uncertain relationship with proportional burden (-).&amp;nbsp; --&amp;gt; &lt;i&gt;APGs, expression maybe better indicate for mutatoin burden than proprotion and dN/dS.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;MMRd cancers (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;n&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; = 6) had significantly higher mutation load than MMRp cancers &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;and all carried &lt;b&gt;clonal high-impact immune escape alterations&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Overall, immune escape alterations were detected in 14 of 29 cancers; these were clonal in 8 cases and subclonal in 6 (all MMRp; Extended Data Fig.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a data-track=&quot;click&quot; data-track-label=&quot;link&quot; data-track-action=&quot;figure anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://www.nature.com/articles/s41588-025-02349-1#Fig7&quot; style=&quot;vertical-align: baseline; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 102, 153); overflow-wrap: break-word; text-decoration-thickness: 0.0625rem; text-decoration-skip-ink: auto; text-underline-offset: 0.08em; word-break: break-word; box-sizing: inherit; font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;c-article-satellite-title u-h1&quot; data-test=&quot;top-caption&quot; id=&quot;Fig7&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0.67em 0px 16px; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; letter-spacing: min(max(-0.0117156rem, 4vw), -0.0390625rem); line-height: 1.4; box-sizing: inherit; word-break: break-word; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;Phylogenetic trees reconstructed using FF-WGS data of the 29 CRCs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(18, 18, 18)); color: light-dark(rgb(34, 34, 34), rgb(208, 208, 208)); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;By mapping escape alterations onto the evolutionary tree, we can directly infer when tumors acquired immune evasion capabilities&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Harding, Palatino, serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#222222&quot; face=&quot;Harding, Palatino, serif&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Both C536 and C552 show early tumor divergence, with multiple subclones emerging shortly after the trunk. This indicates that the tumors diversified early in their evolution.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;In both cases, immune escape alterations are present:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- In C536, escape events (e.g., HLA-A mutation) occur on specific branches&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- In C552, escape-related alterations (e.g., HSPA6 mutation) are also branch-specific&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;Although some immune-related mutations (e.g., B2M, CIITA) appear on the trunk, full immune escape is not established early and instead evolves in subclones.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;C532 and C527 also show tumor evolution and branching, indicating clonal diversification.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;However, no immune escape alterations are detected on either the trunk or the branches.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1083" width="617" x="1372" y="1586" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="UnI0fS5W2R1EIqpq5tZH-22" parent="1" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" value="" vertex="1">
